      "text": "the bullock … burn with fire without the camp, Ex. 29:14. took the calf which they had made, and burnt it, Ex. 32:20. whore … shall be burnt with fire, Lev. 21:9. even their sons and their daughters they have burnt in the fire, Deut. 12:31. They shall be burnt with hunger, and devoured with burning heat, Deut. 32:24. priests of the high places that burn incense upon thee, 1 Kgs. 13:2. vessels … he burned them without Jerusalem, 2 Kgs. 23:4. he burnt the house of the Lord, 2 Kgs. 25:9. he burnt the bones of the priests upon their altars, 2 Chr. 34:5. built the high places … to burn their sons and their daughters, Jer. 7:31. made intercession to the king that he would not burn the roll, Jer. 36:25. the Chaldeans burned the king’s house, Jer. 39:8 (52:13). the earth is burned at his presence, Nahum 1:5. the day cometh, that shall burn as an oven, Mal. 4:1.",
