      "text": "he will burn up the chaff with unquenchable fire, Matt. 3:12 (Luke 3:17). tares, and bind them in bundles to burn them, Matt. 13:30 (D&C 38:12; 86:7; 101:66). Did not our heart burn within us, Luke 24:32. brought their books together, and burned them before all men, Acts 19:19. If any man’s work shall be burned, 1 Cor. 3:15. it is better to marry than to burn, 1 Cor. 7:9. though I give my body to be burned, and have not charity, 1 Cor. 13:3. who is offended, and I burn not, 2 Cor. 11:29. bodies of those beasts … burned without the camp, Heb. 13:11. works that are therein shall be burned up, 2 Pet. 3:10. third part of trees … and all green grass was burnt up, Rev. 8:7. shall eat her flesh, and burn her with fire, Rev. 17:16. she shall be utterly burned with fire, Rev. 18:8.",
